    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40651" root="نهس" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْهَسٌ</span></b>  <i>A place from which a thing</i> [such as
herbage &amp;c.] <i>is taken with the mouth and eaten:</i>
(K, * TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنَاهِسُ</span>. (TA.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثِيرَةُ المَنَاهِسِ</span> <i>Land abounding in such places.</i>
(TA.)

